      "subject": "Quantitative Reasoning",
      "topic": "Data Interpretation and Charts",
      "difficulty": "hard",
      "question_text": "An investment chart shows stock values over 3 years. Stock X grew by 150%, then lost 40%, then gained 25%. Stock Y grew by a steady continuous rate. Both ended at exactly 1.875 times their original value. What is the false statement below?",
      "options": [
        {
          "letter": "A",
          "text": "During year 2, Stock X fell back down to exactly 1.5 times its entry value."
